P\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(J\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ReducedProduct}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ReducedProduct}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"390d99173de7c15c\" href=\"?note=390d99173de7c15c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"eddbbbc6fc10dcfa\" href=\"?note=eddbbbc6fc10dcfa\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9ced46394294c1a6\" href=\"?note=9ced46394294c1a6\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-quotient.md\">../batch19/58-df-quotient.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}reduced\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ReducedProduct}_S(A,J,P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S(A,J)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists E_J\\;\\Bigl(\nE_J=\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in(\\prod A)\\times(\\prod A)\\mid\n\\{a\\in A\\mid f(a)\\neq g(a)\\}\\in J\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(P,\\prod A,E_J)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}reduced\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3ReducedProduct}_S(A,J,P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3IdealOnCardinalSet}_S(A,J)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists E_J\\;\\Bigl(\nE_J=\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in(\\prod A)\\times(\\prod A)\\mid\n\\{a\\in A\\mid f(a)\\neq g(a)\\}\\in J\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(P,\\prod A,E_J)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-quotient.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ced46394294c1a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-quotient.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"390d99173de7c15c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"eddbbbc6fc10dcfa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"390d99173de7c15c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","